# NOTE: despite the name, we don't run Prettier. `vp fmt` (oxfmt) reads
# .gitignore and .prettierignore by default — there is no .oxfmtignore — so this
# is the file that tells the code formatter what to leave alone.

# Authored prose (Patterns, Blog posts, CONTEXT) is hand-formatted, not owned by
# the code formatter. Revisit when the content milestone defines doc tooling.
*.md
**/*.md

# Hand-indented, comment-heavy config — keep the readable nesting oxfmt would flatten.
netlify.toml

# Build output / deps (also in .gitignore, listed for tools reading this directly).
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
